Specifically adapted: the C ABI declarations and host-call bridge
(`cmd/passbridge/main.go`), the JSON envelope and error types, and the
per-credential rate-window design with single-probe admission
(`internal/bridge/rate_limit.go`). Everything else — the free-tier request
path, the product-surface gate headers, the YAML config-node reader, the
tool-call aggregation and the management console — is original to this project.
